 * does not cover, as a run of base lines replaced by a run of side lines.
 * Each change is `{ baseStart, baseEnd, sideStart, sideEnd }` with ends
 * exclusive, so an insertion has `baseStart === baseEnd` and a deletion has
 * `sideStart === sideEnd`.
